    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800850/extras/66bc50014ca31edf1e8436ba8a2e2241.avif?t=1752882922\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time, in the Japanese domain of &quot;Ouma&quot;, our story unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is Ouka Sakura\u2014a strong but somewhat foolish samurai. In an era of peace, she has no work, and after getting scolded over something silly, she ends up losing her home and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, she helps a child named Suzune who\u2019s in trouble at a red-light district. That encounter sparks the beginning of a journey to revive the Sakura Style together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The two set their sights on victory in the prestigious \u201cGozenjiai (Castle Tournament),\u201d aiming to rise once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tale of trials and growth begins here!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800850/extras/b2b9dc76681d8c6ee5627adb6b969f08.avif?t=1752882922\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the Gozenjiai! A samurai action RPG of growth and bonds with your beloved disciple!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete requests from townspeople to progress the story, build your reputation, and aim for victory in the grand Gozenjiai!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800850/extras/2c54ad5dbad050d22bb116aa2671f5be.avif?t=1752882922\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side-scrolling RPG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chained command AT battles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With symbol encounters and instant-kill items, even those tired of random battles can play with ease!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Suzune\u2019s Notes&quot; help explain in-game terms\u2014perfect for reviewing forgotten details!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800850/extras/66bc50014ca31edf1e8436ba8a2e2241.avif?t=1752882922\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time, in the Japanese domain of &quot;Ouma&quot;, our story unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist is Ouka Sakura\u2014a strong but somewhat foolish samurai. In an era of peace, she has no work, and after getting scolded over something silly, she ends up losing her home and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, she helps a child named Suzune who\u2019s in trouble at a red-light district. That encounter sparks the beginning of a journey to revive the Sakura Style together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The two set their sights on victory in the prestigious \u201cGozenjiai (Castle Tournament),\u201d aiming to rise once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tale of trials and growth begins here!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800850/extras/b2b9dc76681d8c6ee5627adb6b969f08.avif?t=1752882922\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the Gozenjiai! A samurai action RPG of growth and bonds with your beloved disciple!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete requests from townspeople to progress the story, build your reputation, and aim for victory in the grand Gozenjiai!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800850/extras/2c54ad5dbad050d22bb116aa2671f5be.avif?t=1752882922\" width=616 height=64 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side-scrolling RPG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chained command AT battles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With symbol encounters and instant-kill items, even those tired of random battles can play with ease!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Suzune\u2019s Notes&quot; help explain in-game terms\u2014perfect for reviewing forgotten details!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In Ouma, samurai Ouka Sakura, jobless and foolish, loses her home. She aids Suzune, sparking a quest to revive the Sakura Style. They aim for the Gozenjiai, facing trials in a Japanese-style action RPG. Complete requests, build reputation, and master thrilling battles to win!",
